Then I walked down a small path.
I came right to a large lake.
I went down to the shore.
I walked along the water for a bit there.
After a few minutes, I came to an empty bench.
I sat down on the bench.
Then I opened my backpack.
I unpacked my lunch.
I made the food early in the morning, you know.
Outside in the fresh air, it tasted very good.
I really stayed there a long time.
I just looked at the lake.
The water looked very calm.
Many small boats sailed across the lake.
One boat came very close to the shore.
The people on the boat waved.
I waved back, of course.
The break felt so good, Sofia.
I almost fell asleep in the sun!
